# i18n intermediate files
admin/i18n/flat.txt
admin/i18n/*/flat.txt

# admin UI Vite intermediate build
src-admin/build/

# admin/ holds BOTH hand-maintained static files (icon .png, jsonCustom.json,
# style.css, i18n) and generated Vite output.
#
# The generated Vite output (admin/assets/, admin/index.html, admin/tab.html) IS
# committed so the adapter can be installed directly from GitHub. ioBroker forbids
# install lifecycle scripts, so there is no build-on-install; committing the built
# admin UI is the only way a GitHub install (iobroker install <github-url>) gets a
# working admin page. Otherwise `admin/index.html` is missing and the instance
# settings show "File index.html not found" (404). Rebuilt on release via
# release-script's before_commit hook, same as build/. This mirrors the build/
# strategy below.

# build/ (TypeScript compile output from src/) IS committed so the adapter can be
# installed directly from GitHub. ioBroker forbids install lifecycle scripts, so
# there is no build-on-install; committing build/main.js (package.json "main") is
# the checker's sanctioned way to make GitHub installs work (E5019). Rebuilt on
# release via release-script's before_commit hook. (See ioBroker.meteonomiqs.)

# bundle analyzer output (ANALYZE=1 npm run build in src-admin)
src-admin/stats.html
admin/stats.html

#input
/input/